~ first_return
Bridge: You're back. Whatever survived the dive now feeds tomorrow's plan.
Bridge: Pick one place to spend it first. Night loot only matters once it turns into farm progress, kitchen margin, or the next launch.

~ rare_loot
Bridge: Hold there. That haul is more than filler scrap.
Bridge: Rare finds change menus, unlock paths, and the next day's priorities. Spend them on purpose.

~ poor_run
Bridge: Rough return. Thin loot is still better than an empty deck.
Bridge: Bank what you have, stabilize during daylight, and take the next dive on cleaner footing.
